{"id":"mdefmlya15jjw3m0drs7ddm2o","title":"分子离子峰、碎片峰、同位素峰，如何区分","originalTitle":"分子离子峰、碎片峰、同位素峰，如何区分？","summary":"质谱图通过横坐标质荷比m/z和纵坐标离子信号强度展示离子组成。分子离子峰对应分子电离后未发生骨架裂解的离子，碎片离子峰来自分子裂解，同位素峰源于不同同位素的存在。综合分析峰位、峰强和峰间关系可辅助判断物质结构。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3549522&do=blog&id=1560868"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T04:07:09.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T08:55:58.581Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T08:55:58.581Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a98c850e-2449-4ae5-bb60-d7ac368e8b26","title":"科学网博客讲解质谱图基本要素及分析应用"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a98c850e-2449-4ae5-bb60-d7ac368e8b26","title":"科学网博客讲解质谱图基本要素及分析应用"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fXyrAIjKTSRc","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}